#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduccion"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&okular; is a &kde; universal document viewer based on the code of the "
"&kpdf; application. Although being based on &kpdf; code, &okular; has some "
"unique features such as overview mode, improved presentation support and "
"annotation support."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "Basic Usage"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening Files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view any supported file in &okular;, select <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Open... </guimenuitem></menuchoice>, choose a supported "
"file in the dialogue and click <guibutton>Open</guibutton>. Your file should "
"now be displayed in the main window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have already opened files in &okular; before, you can quickly access "
"them by selecting them in the <menuchoice><guimenu>File</"
"guimenu><guisubmenu>Open Recent</guisubmenu></menuchoice> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After having a file opened you probably want to read it and therefore "
"navigate through it. Go to the <link linkend=\"navigating\">next section</"
"link> to learn more about this."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Navigating"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "This section describes how you can navigate through a document in &okular;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways of scrolling the viewing area. One is to use the "
"<keycap>Up Arrow</keycap> and <keycap>Down Arrow</keycap> keys. You may also "
"use the scrollbar, your mousewheel or the <keycap>Page Up</keycap> and "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap> keys."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Another way is to hold the &LMB; down at any place on the document while "
"dragging the mouse in the opposite direction of where you want to move. This "
"procedure only works if the Browse Tool is enabled, which you can select by "
"choosing <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</guimenu><guimenuitem>Browse Tool </"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The navigation panel on the left side of the screen enables two more ways of "
"navigating through a document:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you click on a page thumbnail the viewing area will be brought to that "
"page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the document has a table of contents, clicking on a table of contents "
"item will bring the document to to the page linked to that item."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some documents have links. In this case you can click on them and the view "
"will change to the page it links to. If the link is to a web page or some "
"other document the default &kde; handler for that format will be invoked."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally, you may use the following functionality to quickly move to "
"specific places in the document:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the first page of the document using <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Home</keycap></keycombo> or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>First Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the last page of the document using <keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>End</keycap></keycombo> or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Last Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the next page of the document using <keycap>Space</keycap>, "
"<keycap>Page Down</keycap>, the <guibutton>Next Page</guibutton> Toolbar "
"button or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Next Page</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can go to the previous page of the document using <keycap>Backspace</"
"keycap>, <keycap>Page Up</keycap>, the <guibutton>Previous Page</guibutton> "
"Toolbar button or using <menuchoice> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Previous Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid "Presentation Mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Presentation mode represents another way to view documents in &okular;. "
"It can be enabled in <menuchoice><guimenu>View</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Presentation</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. It shows the "
"document on a page per page basis. The pages are shown with zoom to page, "
"that means all the page is visible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&PDF; documents can even specify that they are always opened in presentation "
"mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When in presentation mode, you have an helper bar located on the top of the "
"screen. Just move the mouse cursor to the top of the screen to make it "
"appear."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To navigate between pages you may use the &LMB; (next page) and the &RMB; "
"(previous page), the mouse wheel, the arrow icons or the line edit in the "
"top bar, or the keys specified in the <link linkend=\"navigating"
"\">Navigating</link> section."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can exit presentation mode at any time by pressing the <keycap>ESC</"
"keycap> key or clicking the <guiicon>Quit</guiicon> icon in the top bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also draw on the current page with a pencil. Click on the "
"<guilabel>Toggle Drawing Mode</guilabel> icon in the top bar to enable or "
"disable the possibility of draw in the presentation mode. The drawings are "
"cleared automatically when switching to another page, or manually selecting "
"the <guilabel>Erase Drawings</guilabel> icon in the top bar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:209
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Presentation mode has some configuration options, you can find their "
"description at <link linkend=\"configpresentation\">Configuring &okular;</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid "&okular; Advanced Features"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Embedded Files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the current document has some files embedded in it, when you open it a "
"yellow bar will appear above the page view to notify you about the embedded "
"files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:225
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The embedded files bar</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The embedded files bar</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In this case, you can either click on the link in the text of the bar or "
"choose <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Embedded Files</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice> to open the embedded files dialog. The dialog "
"allows you to view the embedded files and to extract them."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid "Annotations"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:244
#, no-c-format
msgid "&okular; allows you to review and annotate your documents."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Due to DRM limitations (typically with &PDF; documents), adding, editing "
"some properties or removing annotations could not be possible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:254
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding annotations"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add some annotations to the document, you have to activate the annotating "
"toolbar. This is done by either selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Tools</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Review</guimenuitem></menuchoice> or pressing "
"<keycap>F6</keycap>. Once the annotating toolbar is shown, just press one of "
"its buttons to start constructing that annotation."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The annotating toolbar can be docked in any side of the viewing are: just "
"drag it to move it to another place."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:269
#, no-c-format
msgid "Activating the annotating toolbar will make you switch to the Normal Mode."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can stop the construction any time by pressing again on the button of "
"the annotation you are constructing."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The newly constructed annotation will have as author the author you set in "
"the <guilabel>Identity</guilabel> section in the <link linkend=\"configure"
"\">settings</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removing annotations"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove an annotation, just click on it with the &RMB;, and select "
"<guimenuitem>Remove</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:289
#, no-c-format
msgid "When removing the annotation, its window will be closed if open."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option could not be enabled because the document does not allow "
"removing annotations."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing annotations"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit an annotation, click on it with the &RMB; and select "
"<guimenuitem>Properties...</guimenuitem>. A dialog will appear with the "
"general annotation settings (like color and opacity, author, &etc;) and the "
"settings specific to that annotation type."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending on the document permissions (typically with &PDF; documents), some "
"options can be disabled."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Menubar"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>File</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>O</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:334
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open</action> a supported file. If there is already an opened file "
"it will be closed. For more information, see the section about <link linkend="
"\"opening\">Opening Files</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Open Recent</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open</action> a file which was used previously from a submenu. If a "
"file is currently being displayed it will be closed. For more information, "
"see the section about <link linkend=\"opening\">Opening Files</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save As...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:366
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Save</action> the currently open file under a different name."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Print</action> the currently displayed document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Print Preview...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:393
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Show a preview</action> of how the currently displayed document "
"would be printed with the default options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:402
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Display some basic information</action> about the document, such as "
"title, author, creation date, and details about the fonts used. The "
"available information depends on the type of document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Embedded Files...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:421
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Show the files embedded</action> in the document, if the document "
"has any. For more information, see the section about the <link linkend="
"\"embedded-files\">Embedded Files</link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:429
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Close</action> &okular;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>F</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Find...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:454
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show the find bar on the bottom of the viewing area that allows you to "
"<action>search for a string in the document</action>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:463
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F3</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Find Next</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:470
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Try to <action>find the previous searched string again</action> in the "
"document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:477
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>View</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:481
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>P</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Presentation</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Activates</action> the Presentation Mode. For more information, see "
"the section about <link linkend=\"presentationMode\">Presentation Mode</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:494
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom In</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Increase the magnification</action> of the document view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:507
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom Out</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:514
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Decrease the magnification</action> of the document view."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:519
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Fit Width</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:525
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change the magnification</action> of the document view to a value "
"that makes the pages' width equal to the document view's width."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:532
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Fit Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Change the magnification</action> of the document view to a value "
"that makes at least one whole page visible."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Continuous</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Enable the continuous page mode</action>. In continuous mode, all "
"pages of the document are shown, and you can scroll through them without "
"having to use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Previous "
"Page</guimenuitem></menuchoice> and <menuchoice><guimenu>Go</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Next Page</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> options."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:560
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>View Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu makes you choose the view mode for the pages. The possible "
"options are: <guimenuitem>Single Page</guimenuitem> (only one page per row), "
"<guimenuitem>Facing Pages</guimenuitem> (two pages per row, in a book style) "
"and <guimenuitem>Overview</guimenuitem> (the number of columns is the one "
"specified in the <link linkend=\"configure\">&okular; settings</link>)."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Orientation</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:581
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu allows you to <action>changes the orientation</action> of the "
"pages of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:586
#, no-c-format
msgid "The rotation is applied to the orientation of every page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select <guimenuitem>Original Orientation</guimenuitem> to restore "
"the orientation of the document, discarding all the rotations applied "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Page Size</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:605
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Changes the size of the pages</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This submenu is active only if the current type of document supports "
"different page sizes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show/Hide Forms</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:624
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Show or hides the display</action> of the form fields of the "
"document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:629
#, no-c-format
msgid "This submenu is active only if the current document has form fields."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:640
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Go</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:644
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Backspace</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Previous Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:651
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>View the previous page</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:656
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>Space</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Next Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:663
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>View the next page</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:668
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Home</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>First Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:675
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Go to the first page</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>End</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Last Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:687
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Go to the last page</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:692
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Left</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Back</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:699
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Go back to the previous view</action> of the document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:704
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Right</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Forward</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:711
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Move forward to the next view</action> of the document. This only "
"works if you have already moved back before."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:716
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>G</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Go to Page</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:723
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open a dialog which allows you to <action>go to any page</action> of the "
"document."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:730
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:734
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Add/Remove Bookmark</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:740
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Add or remove a bookmark for the current page</action>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:747
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Previous Bookmark</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:753
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Go to the previous bookmarked page</action>, or do nothing if there "
"are no bookmarked pages prior to the current one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:759
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Next Bookmark</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:765
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Go to the next bookmarked page</action>, or do nothing if there are "
"no bookmarked pages after the current one."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:773
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:777
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>1</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Browse Tool</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:784
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mouse will have its normal behaviour, &LMB; for dragging the document "
"and following links and &RMB; for adding bookmarks and fit to width."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:789
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom Tool</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:796
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mouse will work as a zoom tool. Clicking &LMB; and dragging will zoom "
"the view to the selected area, clicking &RMB; will bring the document back "
"to the previous zoom."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:801
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>3</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Select Tool</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:808
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mouse will work as a select tool. In that mode clicking &LMB; and "
"dragging will give the option of copying the text/image of current the "
"selected area to the clipboard, speak a text or to save an image to a file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:813
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>4</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Text Selection Tool</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:820
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The mouse will work as a text selection tool. In that mode clicking &LMB; "
"and dragging will give the option of selecting the text of the document. "
"Then, just click with the &RMB; to copy to the clipboard or speak the "
"current selection."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:827
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>F6</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Tools</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Review</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:834
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Open the review toolbar</action>. The review toolbar allows you to "
"add annotations on the document you are reading. For more information, "
"please see the section about <link linkend=\"annotations\">Annotations</"
"link>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:843
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> Menu"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:847
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>M</keycap></keycombo></"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show/Hide Menubar</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:854
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Toggle the Menubar display</action> on and off. Once hidden it can "
"be made visible using the &RMB; menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:860
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show/Hide Toolbar</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:866
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Toggle the Toolbar display</action> on and off."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F7</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Show/Hide Navigation Panel</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:879
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Toggle the navigation panel</action> on and off."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:884
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>F</keycap></"
"keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Full Screen "
"Mode</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:891
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Enables the full screen mode</action>. Note that full screen mode is "
"different from <link linkend=\"presentationMode\">presentation mode</link> "
"insofar as the only peculiarity of full screen mode is that it hides the "
"window decorations, the menubar and the toolbar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:900
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Shortcuts...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:906
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens a window that lets you <action>configure the keyboard shortcuts</"
"action> for many menu commands."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:912
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Toolbars...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:918
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens a window that lets you choose which icons are visible in the toolbar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:924
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &okular;...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:930
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the <link linkend=\"configure\">Configure</link> window."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:936
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure Backends...</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:942
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opens the <link linkend=\"configure\">Backend Configuration</link> window."
msgstr ""

